  "answer_markdown": "The personnel cost as a percentage of revenue for Environmental Lab Testing has increased from 46.3% in 2023 to 47.4% in Jan-Oct 2026, a 0.8 pp increase compared to the budget of 46.0% for the same period, which is unfavourable. This trend is driven by higher personnel charges in the latest months, particularly in Jan 2025, where the percentage reached 52.9%, compared to the lowest in Oct 2024 at 42.9%.\n\n- Actual by calendar year: 2023 46.3% (full year), 2024 46.5% (full year), 2025 46.4% (full year), 2026 47.4% (Jan-Oct)\n- Latest month Oct 2026: Actual 44.1%, Budget 43.3%\n- Rolling 12-month Personnel charges / Revenue: Jan 2023 46.5% -> Oct 2026 47.3% (up 0.8 pp)",
